  Description: Yearning for all to live in harmony, you make every attempt to redeem
    those others might slay or dismiss. Edicts try to redeem those who commit wicked
    deeds, show compassion to others regardless of their authority or station Anathema
    kill a sapient enemy without first offering a chance at redemption Champion's
    Reaction @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Glimpse of Redemption] Relentless
    Reaction (9th Level) If the enemy refuses, it takes persistent @Damage[@actor.abilities.cha.mod[spirit,persistent]]{persistent
    spirit damage} equal to your Charisma modifier. Exalted Reaction (11th Level)
    If the enemy refuses, you can choose to grant the resistance to yourself and
    all allies in your champion's aura, including the triggering ally. If you do,
    the resistance is reduced by 2 for all
